title: Door3BInside
---
// Talk target just inside 3B's door (Interact layer).
-> Go out <<if visited("Route1Thu2Start") and not visited("Route1Thu2Door")>>
    <<open_door Door3B>>
    <<walk Player PlayerOutOf3B>>
    <<close_door Door3B>>
-> Look
    <<if visited("Route1Thu2Dinner")>>
        You: It's late. I'm not going anywhere.
    <<else>>
        You: My door. From the inside it feels more like mine.
    <<endif>>
===
